    "title": "Suni Lee announces gymnastics comeback for LA28 Olympics - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Allie Johnson ,\n1 days ago ST. PAUL, Minn. (FOX 9) - American gymnast and six-time Olympic medalist Suni Lee is returning to gymnastics, attempting to qualify for the Los Angeles 2028 Summer Olympics. The St. Paul, Minnesota native announced her comeback on social media Tuesday, posting a message that her gymnastics journey is not over yet. Read full article",
